        date+commit schema, modules/raven/SKILL.md); the formula version 0.1.0 is
        the tap's semver for that pin.

        The graphics translation set (dxvk / vkd3d-proton) is NOT part of this
        install: nothing probes it beside the binary. GPU workloads need a
        provisioned graphics tree pointed at by RAVEN_D3D_DIRECTORY; console
        workloads (the --run-process lane) need nothing beyond this install.
      EOS
    end
  end

  test do
    # The usage-banner smoke (the module's own //:smoke semantics, raven
    # 0002-02 row 2.4's gate): upstream raven has no --help flag — an
    # unrecognized argument prints the usage banner to stderr and exits 2, and
    # the banner carries --run-process. shell_output's second argument pins the
    # EXPECTED exit status, so the non-zero exit is the assertion, not a
    # failure.
    output = shell_output("#{bin}/raven --help 2>&1", 2)
    assert_match "--run-process", output
  end
